    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweadu sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA, ak ghwayiin jeeda maheemajeanda miinda Dawdi was heechea goobiida; ak ghoadayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea hoyyoo aba madeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea niihiit Dawdi giidaydeayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda ea haleanjeeda sighadoawanda bea hoyyoo, ghoadaw buuneeda ghawooda aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwalakiisa giliwas sih bea Israeli, headiga ea gadeemga, ak ghoadaw giliwas sih mukaateeyda ngaano, ea beashadeeda biyeeyda, sea mukaateeyda sabiibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha buuneeda mwaatkwa bea Lawi ak ghwanung' gagadiiy aba madeeda sandakwajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwasin gichea eepkeata, ea badiischooda, ea giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida haweewa saawa ea Asafu gil, nea deaba iyeenya bassa ea Sekariyahi, ea Yeieli, ea Shemiramoti, ea Yehieli, ea Matitiya, ea Eliyabu, ea Benaya, ea Obed-edomu, ea Yeieli mideawa ginandajeega ea gidoondoorajeega; nea Asafu niny ea siida bara gureayeeka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sea ashoohoodiga was Benaya ea Yahasieli gaguuda durumbeati galeagasean, aba madeeda sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu eaweedida ghwanung' Dawdi ghanyi eesarman duumda badiischeesiinda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gamiineadaysa Asafu sea buweadeagaaschi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sarmeeda giigheambiita",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Badita ASEETA aba Yerusalemu ea Gibeoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwanung'usa Dawdi hoowa Asafu sea buweadeagaaschi madeeda sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA nea gagadiiyeesa galeaga sean, aba gisigasiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Obed-edomu, sea buweadeagaaschi alaadam ea sis; Obed-edomu sea orjeeda Yedutuni, sea Hosa, ghoah furiischoodiga dooshta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwanung'usa Sadoki was ashoohoocheanda sea buweadeagaaschi was ashoohoodiga madeeda heeda ghaydit bea NG'UTAMIIDA mida heetiyeada was Gibeoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghoadayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda galeaga sean sakteayda ea shing'ada, gawuurji gissing'oarda ng'asheega sean aba jeeda deaweedeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi rukusa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda saawa gwandeayi sea Hemani ea Yedutuni mideawa gujaweeda ea gureayeeka, ea buuneeda mwaatkwa siloat jea gwasarmasa NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba bariinyeagaaschi bea huumwa gayghwashng'u damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Hemani ea Yedutuni gaguuda durumbeatajeega ea haleanjeeda sarmeeda siikghaambiida ASEETA; nea orjooga Yedutuni gealoat ghoah fuga dooshta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadarda buuneesean ak gaba siisi weah gheanyi, ak gawa Dawdi ghoah ak ghoadaw gheanyi ghawooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
